<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6460" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναδίπλ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>convolution,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἐντέρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					508b13
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				675b2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>repetition, duplication,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				103.37
			</span></i>; esp. in Rhet. (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαναδίπλωσις</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				66
			</span></i>, al., Alex <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fig.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Medic.,
				<i>double infection,</i> in malarial fevers, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.369
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				<u>Febr.</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>reduplication,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Trypho
				<u>Fr.</u>
				12
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
